1
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:55,719
I said, give me back that sheet!

2
00:00:55,719 --> 00:00:56,759
Get out.

3
00:00:56,759 --> 00:00:57,240
Get lost!

4
00:03:27,439 --> 00:03:28,240
Professor Yu,

5
00:03:29,479 --> 00:03:30,240
here's your coffee.

6
00:03:31,599 --> 00:03:32,319
I didn't know that for your coffee,

7
00:03:32,319 --> 00:03:34,400
you only use this brand of water.

8
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,479
I went out of my way to buy it.

9
00:03:35,479 --> 00:03:36,719
Sorry to keep you waiting.

10
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,400
What brand?

11
00:03:42,039 --> 00:03:42,960
Who told you

12
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,159
I only drink this brand of water?

13
00:03:44,759 --> 00:03:46,879
Your assistant Zhao Xidan just told me.

14
00:03:47,759 --> 00:03:48,599
Zhao Xidan?

15
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:51,520
Zhao Xidan is on another project today.

16
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,280
She didn't come in.

17
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,560
Zhao Xidan and a male assistant

18
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,319
were just here.

19
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:58,919
Damn it!

20
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:03,319
Have you seen Director Xu?

21
00:04:03,879 --> 00:04:04,280
No.

22
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,360
Have you seen Director Xu?

23
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,719
Has anyone seen Director Xu?

24
00:04:14,719 --> 00:04:15,520
No.

25
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:18,759
Has...

26
00:04:18,759 --> 00:04:19,800
Have you seen Director Xu?

27
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:20,240
Who?

28
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:20,920
Director Xu.

29
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:21,600
Director Xu?

30
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,040
Yeah.

31
00:04:22,319 --> 00:04:23,079
Who are you?

32
00:04:23,519 --> 00:04:23,920
Hey!

33
00:04:24,959 --> 00:04:25,319
Hey!

34
00:04:25,319 --> 00:04:26,360
Lao Liu, Lao Liu!

35
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:28,079
Did Director Xu just leave?

36
00:04:28,079 --> 00:04:29,600
Director Xu didn't come in today.

37
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,120
What?

38
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:37,519
Hey, what are you doing?!

39
00:04:37,839 --> 00:04:38,600
Professor Yu!

40
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,079
Professor Yu!

41
00:04:43,079 --> 00:04:43,920
Stop right there!

42
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:45,800
Call the police!

43
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,240
Quick!

44
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,519
Call the police, hurry!

45
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,920
Hello, is this the police?

46
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:51,879
Someone's been kidnapped!

47
00:05:02,199 --> 00:05:02,839
Captain Liu.

48
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,120
Is there anything else around here...

49
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:11,879
Li Liang.

50
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:12,920
Yes, Captain.

51
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:13,720
Captain Liu,

52
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:14,480
based on our investigation,

53
00:05:15,079 --> 00:05:16,680
this Director Xu is an impostor.

54
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:17,720
She fooled everyone,

55
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,639
including Professor Yu.

56
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,680
Impersonating the director

57
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:22,879
and kidnapping someone...

58
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,120
She's no ordinary criminal.

59
00:05:24,639 --> 00:05:26,480
The real Director Xu is on her way.

60
00:05:26,839 --> 00:05:27,639
Where's Da Pan?

61
00:05:28,879 --> 00:05:29,600
Let's go.

62
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,199
Captain Liu.

63
00:05:34,199 --> 00:05:34,600
Yeah.

64
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:37,079
Colleagues from forensics

65
00:05:37,079 --> 00:05:39,199
have processed all prints at the scene.

66
00:05:41,319 --> 00:05:42,120
You reported this?

67
00:05:42,399 --> 00:05:43,040
Yes.

68
00:05:52,079 --> 00:05:53,160
She's the one who stole the drug.

69
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,040
Captain Liu,

70
00:05:56,439 --> 00:05:57,519
we retrieved the surveillance footage.

71
00:05:57,519 --> 00:05:58,759
But you two better brace yourselves.

72
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:01,959
Let's go.

73
00:06:02,639 --> 00:06:03,199
Brother Li.

74
00:06:03,199 --> 00:06:03,680
Yeah.

75
00:06:06,839 --> 00:06:07,680
After investigating,

76
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,560
this Director Xu is an impostor.

77
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:10,439
She fooled everyone,

78
00:06:10,439 --> 00:06:11,319
including Professor Yu.

79
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,879
At the drug testing institute...

80
00:06:12,879 --> 00:06:14,519
Wait, that's what I just said!

81
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:19,399
This is a blatant provocation!

82
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,480
At least one thing is certain:

83
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:25,160
among the suspects,

84
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,639
there is a skilled hacker.

85
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,879
What time frame of footage was wiped?

86
00:06:32,439 --> 00:06:34,439
From 1:40 to 2:10 p.m.

87
00:06:34,639 --> 00:06:35,560
After the surveillance was recovered,

88
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,120
did it capture any valuable footage?

89
00:06:38,199 --> 00:06:38,879
No.

90
00:07:06,399 --> 00:07:07,240
As far as we know,

91
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:10,040
many private pharmaceutical companies

92
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,600
wanted to partner with Professor Yu's team

93
00:07:13,399 --> 00:07:14,920
to develop Lahrburg.

94
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:16,480
However,

95
00:07:17,319 --> 00:07:18,759
Professor Yu Kang turned them all down.

96
00:07:19,519 --> 00:07:20,279
In the end,

97
00:07:20,839 --> 00:07:23,199
Professor Yu chose instead to partner

98
00:07:23,199 --> 00:07:25,120
with Yujiang Pharmaceutical Research Center.

99
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,879
On the day of the incident,

100
00:07:27,759 --> 00:07:30,040
Prof. Yu was taking the reagent samples

101
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:32,160
to the research center

102
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:33,560
for the handover,

103
00:07:34,319 --> 00:07:35,480
but a robbery took place.

104
00:07:37,319 --> 00:07:38,839
Finding Professor Yu Kang

105
00:07:38,839 --> 00:07:40,199
is our top priority.

106
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,360
We must prioritize ensuring

107
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,680
Professor Yu Kang's safety.

108
00:07:44,319 --> 00:07:46,759
Moreover, Professor Yu Kang's abduction

109
00:07:47,079 --> 00:07:49,519
halted the development of Lahrburg.

110
00:07:50,439 --> 00:07:51,240
This is because,

111
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,519
in the drug's development process,

112
00:07:53,519 --> 00:07:55,120
several crucial formulas

113
00:07:55,879 --> 00:07:57,439
are known only to Professor Yu Kang.

114
00:07:58,160 --> 00:07:59,279
If

115
00:07:59,279 --> 00:08:01,040
this project is shelved now,

116
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:03,879
to the public,

117
00:08:04,639 --> 00:08:07,000
especially those waiting for its release,

118
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:08,279
the ordinary citizens,

119
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:11,000
the consequences will be devastating.

120
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,560
Taking all factors into account,

121
00:08:17,279 --> 00:08:18,040
at this stage,

122
00:08:18,759 --> 00:08:20,240
we must strictly block

123
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,639
news of Professor Yu Kang's disappearance

124
00:08:23,399 --> 00:08:24,720
to prevent anyone from taking advantage.

125
00:08:25,639 --> 00:08:26,680
Right now,

126
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:27,560
there is zero

127
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:29,600
public data on the Lahrburg reagent.

128
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:31,639
If this reagent falls into

129
00:08:31,639 --> 00:08:33,159
the hands of criminals,

130
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:35,799
the repercussions will be catastrophic.

131
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:36,799
Therefore,

132
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:39,240
finding Professor Yu Kang

133
00:08:39,679 --> 00:08:40,600
and the samples as soon as possible

134
00:08:41,399 --> 00:08:43,200
is the core focus of our next steps

135
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:44,279
and our breakthrough in this case.

136
00:08:44,879 --> 00:08:46,399
By decision of the bureau leadership,

137
00:08:46,879 --> 00:08:48,200
we are establishing the April 20 Task Force.

138
00:08:48,879 --> 00:08:49,840
As head of the task force,

139
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,399
Liao Zhong will be appointed

140
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,879
to lead the investigation.

141
00:08:53,879 --> 00:08:54,519
Liao Zhong.

142
00:08:54,519 --> 00:08:54,960
Sir!

143
00:08:55,399 --> 00:08:57,120
Submit the task force roster ASAP.

144
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,399
Director Song,

145
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:00,480
the roster for the April 20 Task Force...

146
00:09:00,639 --> 00:09:01,720
I've already prepared it.

147
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:02,679
Good.

148
00:09:04,159 --> 00:09:05,240
Meeting adjourned.

149
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,519
Everyone, get ready.

150
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,559
Lala.

151
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:55,120
Hey.

152
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:00,679
Look at this.

153
00:10:00,679 --> 00:10:01,279
Ah.

154
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,080
Look at that.

155
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,120
Your fur is all over the place.

156
00:10:13,639 --> 00:10:14,399
Tang Jinze.

157
00:10:16,799 --> 00:10:17,559
Well, look at that.

158
00:10:18,279 --> 00:10:19,559
The big expert is here.

159
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,360
Lawei, say hello.

160
00:10:22,039 --> 00:10:22,600
Look,

161
00:10:22,879 --> 00:10:23,720
he doesn't like me.

162
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:25,720
Haven't seen my old classmate in a while.

163
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:27,120
Just dropped by to see how you're doing.

164
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:28,759
Come here.

165
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:30,639
Good boy.

166
00:10:30,639 --> 00:10:31,440
Such a good boy.

167
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:35,120
Spending all your days with him,

168
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,879
you've forgotten how to talk to people.

169
00:10:38,399 --> 00:10:39,120
Dogs?

170
00:10:40,399 --> 00:10:42,159
A dog is man's best friend.

171
00:10:43,159 --> 00:10:44,159
As for people,

172
00:10:45,879 --> 00:10:46,759
I've got social anxiety.

173
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:49,559
Oh, what should we do then?

174
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:50,759
How about this?

175
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,360
Just don't treat me like a person.

176
00:10:54,519 --> 00:10:55,200
What's going on?

177
00:10:58,559 --> 00:11:00,240
There's a really tough case.

178
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,320
A task force has been set up,

179
00:11:01,759 --> 00:11:03,200
and I was transferred under your mentor.

180
00:11:04,159 --> 00:11:05,320
Hey, that's great news.

181
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:07,320
He's retiring soon, right?

182
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:08,919
Seize the chance.

183
00:11:08,919 --> 00:11:10,000
You can learn a lot from him.

184
00:11:15,159 --> 00:11:16,279
Captain Liao is getting old.

185
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:22,799
Haven't seen him in three years, right?

186
00:11:24,559 --> 00:11:25,519
This will probably be

187
00:11:25,519 --> 00:11:27,360
his final case before retirement.

188
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:28,600
He's under a lot of pressure.

189
00:11:28,879 --> 00:11:30,320
We all want you to come back.

190
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:35,200
Lao Song,

191
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:37,000
I want to go back too.

192
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:38,360
More than anyone.

193
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,000
After my last undercover mission,

194
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:41,639
my face is too well-known.

195
00:11:41,639 --> 00:11:42,879
What could I even do if I went back?

196
00:11:42,879 --> 00:11:44,559
Tang Jinze, is that really it?

197
00:11:48,639 --> 00:11:50,200
I know who you are.

198
00:11:51,039 --> 00:11:52,679
You shouldn't be living like this.

199
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,000
Come on, Lala.

200
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:01,399
If Yang Jingya were still here,

201
00:12:01,399 --> 00:12:02,799
she wouldn't like seeing you like this.

202
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:27,120
Old Zhu

203
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:49,480
Old Zhu.

204
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:50,759
The check, please.

205
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:53,320
No need.

206
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,039
Lao Liao...

207
00:12:55,519 --> 00:12:57,360
paid for your noodles for the whole year.

208
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,799
Captain Liao.

209
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:34,879
Take a seat, everyone.

210
00:13:35,559 --> 00:13:36,000
Sit down.

211
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:43,320
I'll skip the pleasantries.

212
00:13:43,919 --> 00:13:45,799
The city highly values the April 20 case,

213
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:47,799
so they formed this task force.

214
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:49,840
We're gathered here

215
00:13:50,159 --> 00:13:51,120
for one single purpose:

216
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:52,240
to solve this case as soon as possible.

217
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:55,320
Now, let me briefly

218
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:56,559
introduce the team.

219
00:13:56,559 --> 00:13:57,200
Song Qi,

220
00:13:57,919 --> 00:14:00,159
CID, specializing in criminal psychology.

221
00:14:01,399 --> 00:14:02,200
Mi Zhile,

222
00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:04,559
Cyber Police Detachment technician.

223
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,879
Helped solve multiple cyber fraud cases.

224
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:08,679
We worked together a lot in the past.

225
00:14:10,039 --> 00:14:10,799
Liu Ge,

226
00:14:11,639 --> 00:14:12,879
inspector from our detachment.

227
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:13,879
Very experienced.

228
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:15,879
Pan Ming, Li Liang, and Sun Yue,

229
00:14:16,399 --> 00:14:17,879
officers from our detachment.

230
00:14:18,559 --> 00:14:19,759
That's all for introductions.

231
00:14:19,759 --> 00:14:21,759
You'll get to know each other on the job.

232
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:24,120
Now, let's cut to the chase.

233
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:25,120
Liu Ge will

234
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:26,720
brief us on the April 20 case's

235
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:29,000
latest updates and summary of leads.

236
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:30,200
Go ahead.

237
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:31,559
Pan Ming.

238
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:39,799
Yu Kang.

239
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:42,200
Studied at a top German medical school.

240
00:14:42,519 --> 00:14:43,559
Returned to China in 2017

241
00:14:43,799 --> 00:14:45,600
and founded the Yu Kang Pharma Institute.

242
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:48,399
A renowned psychopharmacologist,

243
00:14:48,879 --> 00:14:50,320
and developer of the Lahrburg reagent.

244
00:14:51,399 --> 00:14:52,679
Currently, the Lahrburg reagent

245
00:14:52,679 --> 00:14:54,559
is in the final pre-clinical trial stage,

246
00:14:55,039 --> 00:14:57,159
requiring tests by a pharma institute.

247
00:14:58,759 --> 00:14:59,559
Xu Yu,

248
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:02,399
Director of Yujiang Pharmaceutical Research Center.

249
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:03,639
In office for 12 years.

250
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:05,799
She participated in R&D and testing

251
00:15:05,799 --> 00:15:07,559
of innovative drugs across various fields.

252
00:15:08,559 --> 00:15:09,480
Originally,

253
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:10,679
the two agreed

254
00:15:10,679 --> 00:15:12,919
to meet at 2:00 PM on April 20

255
00:15:12,919 --> 00:15:14,519
at the Pharmaceutical Research Center

256
00:15:14,519 --> 00:15:16,600
to hand over the Lahrburg reagent sample.

257
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:18,960
However, at 2:00 PM that day,

258
00:15:19,559 --> 00:15:20,679
the Lahrburg reagent went missing.

259
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:23,960
Professor Yu Kang was kidnapped

260
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:25,559
outside the research center's entrance,

261
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:26,600
and his whereabouts are unknown.

262
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:28,679
As for the center's surveillance footage,

263
00:15:29,120 --> 00:15:30,559
everything from 1:40 PM

264
00:15:30,559 --> 00:15:32,759
to 2:10 PM was erased.

265
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:35,120
There were two eyewitnesses that day.

266
00:15:35,639 --> 00:15:38,120
One was Director Xu's secretary.

267
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:39,240
Her desk is located

268
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:41,679
five meters from the crime scene.

269
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:42,559
The second one

270
00:15:42,559 --> 00:15:44,519
was Prof. Yu Kang's assistant, Wu Ling.

271
00:15:44,519 --> 00:15:46,360
She followed Professor Yu Kang

272
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:47,879
into Director Xu's office.

273
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:52,320
From witness and front desk statements,

274
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:54,879
at 1:40 PM on April 20,

275
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:55,960
two people

276
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:58,559
arrived at Director Xu's office.

277
00:15:58,840 --> 00:15:59,559
Just the two of them.

278
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:05,679
One was a female,

279
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:07,480
identified through investigation

280
00:16:07,639 --> 00:16:10,240
as Prof. Yu's assistant, Zhao Xidan.

281
00:16:10,799 --> 00:16:12,120
As for the other male,

282
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:13,320
no one recognized him.

283
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:15,960
Because he arrived at the center

284
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:17,399
together with Zhao Xidan,

285
00:16:17,639 --> 00:16:19,200
he was assumed to be

286
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:20,679
part of Professor Yu Kang's team,

287
00:16:20,879 --> 00:16:21,240
which allowed him

288
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:23,320
to smoothly enter Director Xu's office.

289
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:26,320
May I ask who you are?

290
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:26,759
Hello.

291
00:16:26,759 --> 00:16:27,679
I'm from Professor Yu Kang's

292
00:16:27,679 --> 00:16:29,080
laboratory staff.

293
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:30,000
I've been here before.

294
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:32,000
Oh, I remember.

295
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,320
Director Xu and Professor Yu

296
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:34,360
agreed to meet at 2:00 PM.

297
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:35,200
Did you know that?

298
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:37,720
Yes, Director Xu mentioned it.

299
00:16:38,759 --> 00:16:40,440
But it's still early,

300
00:16:40,679 --> 00:16:41,960
and Director Xu hasn't arrived yet.

301
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:46,039
Why don't you two

302
00:16:46,039 --> 00:16:47,360
wait in her office for a moment?

303
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:48,120
Sure. Thank you.

304
00:16:48,399 --> 00:16:49,159
This way, please.

305
00:17:06,119 --> 00:17:06,880
Hello?

306
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:08,240
Director Xu.

307
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:09,559
Has Professor Yu Kang arrived yet?

308
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,319
His two assistants are already here.

309
00:17:11,319 --> 00:17:12,519
About when will you be back?

310
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:15,240
I'm stuck in traffic due to a breakdown.

311
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:16,200
I'll probably be a bit late.

312
00:17:16,599 --> 00:17:18,000
Please explain the situation to Professor Yu,

313
00:17:19,599 --> 00:17:21,599
and entertain him well.

314
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:22,720
Sure, no problem.

315
00:17:27,640 --> 00:17:28,799
Oh, I'm so sorry.

316
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:31,279
Director Xu just called.

317
00:17:31,279 --> 00:17:33,079
She said she might be slightly delayed.

318
00:17:33,079 --> 00:17:34,880
Could you explain that to Professor Yu?

319
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:35,559
No worries.

320
00:17:35,559 --> 00:17:37,440
Professor Yu is also stuck in traffic.

321
00:17:38,319 --> 00:17:40,200
Do you have this brand of water here?

322
00:17:40,759 --> 00:17:42,559
Professor Yu would like some coffee,

323
00:17:42,720 --> 00:17:43,839
but he only drinks coffee

324
00:17:43,839 --> 00:17:45,880
brewed with this brand of water.

325
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:46,519
Do you have any?

326
00:17:47,039 --> 00:17:48,519
Oh, we actually don't.

327
00:17:49,119 --> 00:17:49,920
Then go buy some.

328
00:17:51,759 --> 00:17:52,240
All right.

329
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:53,799
No problem, I'll go buy it right away.

330
00:17:53,799 --> 00:17:54,720
Please wait a moment.

331
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:07,799
Director Xu's secretary,

332
00:18:07,799 --> 00:18:09,519
how long was she away from her desk?

333
00:18:09,759 --> 00:18:10,599
About 20 minutes.

334
00:18:11,359 --> 00:18:12,400
In other words,

335
00:18:12,559 --> 00:18:13,480
Director Xu's secretary

336
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:14,920
never actually saw Director Xu in person.

337
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:15,480
Yes.

338
00:18:16,440 --> 00:18:18,400
Did you verify traffic conditions that day?

339
00:18:18,559 --> 00:18:19,279
We did.

340
00:18:19,480 --> 00:18:20,559
On April 20th,

341
00:18:20,559 --> 00:18:22,440
at 1:35 p.m.,

342
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:23,839
while passing Ningjiang intersection,

343
00:18:23,839 --> 00:18:25,279
she was held up in traffic for ten minutes.

344
00:18:28,759 --> 00:18:29,960
We can't rule out that criminals

345
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:31,640
deliberately caused the traffic jam

346
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:33,319
to delay Director Xu's arrival.

347
00:18:33,839 --> 00:18:34,960
And the phone call

348
00:18:34,960 --> 00:18:36,799
Director Xu supposedly made to her secretary?

349
00:18:37,119 --> 00:18:37,880
Director Xu said

350
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:39,440
she definitely didn't call her secretary

351
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:40,440
during that time window.

352
00:18:40,839 --> 00:18:42,559
I ran tests on the landlines

353
00:18:42,559 --> 00:18:43,480
in Director Xu's office and the front desk.

354
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:45,240
The signal source of the call

355
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:46,440
received by the secretary

356
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:47,359
was highly suspicious.

357
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:49,440
Tracing it completely, however,

358
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:50,519
will take a bit more time.

359
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:53,440
Which means

360
00:18:54,240 --> 00:18:56,000
hacking the research center,

361
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:57,759
causing the traffic jam,

362
00:18:58,119 --> 00:19:00,559
and calling the secretary as Director Xu

363
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:02,279
was all done by the same crew.

364
00:19:02,759 --> 00:19:03,720
Let me add something.

365
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:04,920
The only person who saw this

366
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:06,799
fake Director Xu was Wu Ling.

367
00:19:07,240 --> 00:19:08,440
According to her,

368
00:19:08,440 --> 00:19:09,920
she could barely tell the two apart.

369
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:12,160
What did Wu Ling say?

370
00:19:12,920 --> 00:19:14,519
Wu Ling said when she and Professor Yu

371
00:19:14,519 --> 00:19:15,920
arrived at the office...

372
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:19,640
Professor Yu.

373
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:21,559
I'm Director Xu's assistant.

374
00:19:21,799 --> 00:19:22,680
Hello.

375
00:19:26,160 --> 00:19:26,880
Please, come in.

376
00:19:28,400 --> 00:19:29,119
Come in.

377
00:19:30,839 --> 00:19:31,640
Director Xu,

378
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:32,519
Professor Yu is here.

379
00:19:32,759 --> 00:19:33,559
Professor Yu.

380
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:34,880
Director Xu.

381
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:36,160
Hello, hello.

382
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:37,039
I've been expecting you.

383
00:19:37,039 --> 00:19:38,279
I'm terribly sorry.

384
00:19:38,279 --> 00:19:39,599
Traffic was awful.

385
00:19:40,079 --> 00:19:41,640
At this hour, completely normal.

386
00:19:43,960 --> 00:19:44,759
Wait a second.

387
00:19:46,559 --> 00:19:47,519
What about Zhao Xidan?

388
00:19:48,119 --> 00:19:49,480
The secretary didn't see her after that.

389
00:19:50,160 --> 00:19:51,279
What about after the crime?

390
00:19:51,279 --> 00:19:52,680
We immediately went

391
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:53,960
to Professor Yu Kang's lab

392
00:19:53,960 --> 00:19:54,920
to verify.

393
00:19:55,440 --> 00:19:57,119
On the day of the incident, Zhao Xidan

394
00:19:57,119 --> 00:19:59,200
was working in the lab the whole time.

395
00:19:59,200 --> 00:20:00,880
Her colleagues can all vouch for her.

396
00:20:09,599 --> 00:20:10,880
What if it was a disguise?

397
00:20:13,119 --> 00:20:14,440
Like prosthetics or something?

398
00:20:19,519 --> 00:20:20,839
Let me introduce everyone.

399
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:21,960
Tang Jinze.

400
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:24,000
Former detective in our Songgang District,

401
00:20:24,160 --> 00:20:26,160
he's back now that his secondment has ended.

402
00:20:29,319 --> 00:20:30,119
Mentor.

403
00:20:31,039 --> 00:20:33,519
If the suspect is skilled at disguise,

404
00:20:36,400 --> 00:20:38,319
they could first pose as Zhao Xidan

405
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:41,559
to enter Director Xu's office,

406
00:20:43,559 --> 00:20:45,559
and then change into Director Xu.

407
00:20:45,559 --> 00:20:46,359
Come in.

408
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:49,359
Director Xu...

409
00:21:02,759 --> 00:21:04,519
Of course, I'm just guessing. Just a guess.

410
00:21:10,440 --> 00:21:11,519
Using disguises

411
00:21:11,519 --> 00:21:12,680
could indeed explain

412
00:21:13,039 --> 00:21:14,440
Zhao Xidan's alibi.

413
00:21:16,119 --> 00:21:17,640
But we don't have any evidence

414
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:19,440
to corroborate this disguise theory.

415
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:21,640
After the incident,

416
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:23,880
Forensics processed the crime scene.

417
00:21:24,680 --> 00:21:26,319
Didn't they find any new leads?

418
00:21:26,559 --> 00:21:27,839
The scene only had

419
00:21:28,680 --> 00:21:29,680
fingerprints from Professor Yu Kang,

420
00:21:30,559 --> 00:21:32,440
Wu Ling, and the staff.

421
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:34,519
The footprints were a chaotic mess.

422
00:21:35,559 --> 00:21:37,559
It seems this crew came prepared

423
00:21:37,920 --> 00:21:39,000
and wiped their fingerprints.

424
00:21:39,839 --> 00:21:41,359
Putting all the intel together,

425
00:21:41,559 --> 00:21:43,200
before committing the crime, the suspects

426
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:44,640
planned everything meticulously.

427
00:21:44,640 --> 00:21:46,599
They conned both sides at the same time.

428
00:21:47,359 --> 00:21:49,440
Add to that a hacker among them,

429
00:21:49,920 --> 00:21:51,920
and if there's a master of disguise as well,

430
00:21:51,920 --> 00:21:53,240
it'd make pulling this off even easier.

431
00:21:54,160 --> 00:21:56,000
This is a highly covert crime, isn't it?

432
00:21:57,079 --> 00:21:58,400
Not just highly covert,

433
00:21:58,599 --> 00:21:59,559
they're also extremely daring.

434
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:02,240
What about Professor Yu Kang?

435
00:22:03,240 --> 00:22:05,000
I checked the surveillance along the route.

436
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:05,759
As for the vehicle,

437
00:22:05,759 --> 00:22:08,039
it disappeared into a camera blind spot.

438
00:22:08,039 --> 00:22:10,359
The DMV has no record of the plates,

439
00:22:10,359 --> 00:22:11,680
so it's definitely cloned.

440
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:12,920
And beyond that...

441
00:22:14,920 --> 00:22:17,119
The suspects wore fake faces,

442
00:22:17,519 --> 00:22:19,519
and they left no footage on any cameras.

443
00:22:20,319 --> 00:22:21,559
Right now, the trail of that car

444
00:22:21,559 --> 00:22:23,000
is our only lead.

445
00:22:23,599 --> 00:22:24,359
Liu Ge.

446
00:22:24,359 --> 00:22:25,279
Keep a close eye on it.

447
00:22:25,920 --> 00:22:26,359
Yes, sir.

448
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:28,680
Alright.

449
00:22:28,680 --> 00:22:29,680
Everyone,

450
00:22:29,680 --> 00:22:30,599
keep pushing,

451
00:22:30,599 --> 00:22:31,960
and brainstorm more angles.

452
00:22:31,960 --> 00:22:32,440
Yes, sir.

453
00:22:32,440 --> 00:22:32,880
Meeting adjourned.

454
00:22:33,240 --> 00:22:34,200
Yes, sir.

455
00:23:02,680 --> 00:23:03,559
Mentor,

456
00:23:04,079 --> 00:23:05,279
where's my desk?

457
00:23:19,960 --> 00:23:20,759
As for this scene,

458
00:23:20,759 --> 00:23:22,559
we've inspected it many times.

459
00:23:22,559 --> 00:23:23,680
If you have any questions,

460
00:23:23,680 --> 00:23:24,680
just ask me directly.

461
00:23:32,200 --> 00:23:33,720
Two people went in together.

462
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:36,799
One was disguised as Director Xu,

463
00:23:37,400 --> 00:23:39,000
and then the two took the samples away.

464
00:23:40,759 --> 00:23:42,119
It's a bold idea.

465
00:23:43,279 --> 00:23:44,119
Not that complicated, though.

466
00:23:44,880 --> 00:23:46,440
Following your logic,

467
00:23:46,720 --> 00:23:48,039
it makes sense to me.

468
00:23:48,200 --> 00:23:49,119
However,

469
00:23:49,400 --> 00:23:51,200
we still can't confirm

470
00:23:51,920 --> 00:23:52,920
what they look like.

471
00:23:53,440 --> 00:23:54,880
The computer control room and the front desk

472
00:23:54,880 --> 00:23:56,400
are potential variables.

473
00:23:57,640 --> 00:23:59,119
That's why we still need to check.

474
00:24:04,759 --> 00:24:06,720
What equipment do you usually maintain?

475
00:24:06,960 --> 00:24:08,200
Mostly this area,

476
00:24:08,200 --> 00:24:09,599
and the servers in the back.

477
00:24:11,640 --> 00:24:12,880
Have any outsiders been here recently?

478
00:24:13,319 --> 00:24:14,680
No.

479
00:24:15,279 --> 00:24:17,640
Just routine maintenance last week,

480
00:24:17,640 --> 00:24:19,319
but they were from the equipment company.

481
00:24:19,640 --> 00:24:20,599
All familiar faces.

482
00:24:20,599 --> 00:24:21,519
No outsiders.

483
00:24:23,160 --> 00:24:24,920
Pull up their surveillance footage for me.

484
00:24:24,920 --> 00:24:25,640
Alright.

485
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:16,839
Hey.

486
00:25:17,119 --> 00:25:18,559
Here's the call I tracked down,

487
00:25:18,559 --> 00:25:19,880
the one the female employee answered.

488
00:25:20,119 --> 00:25:20,519
Through

489
00:25:20,519 --> 00:25:21,920
a reverse IP trace,

490
00:25:22,279 --> 00:25:24,079
I found the signal source of the call

491
00:25:24,079 --> 00:25:25,920
the secretary took during the crime.

492
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:27,519
It came from inside the institute.

493
00:25:29,359 --> 00:25:30,559
Which means

494
00:25:30,720 --> 00:25:32,680
the call Director Xu's secretary received

495
00:25:33,240 --> 00:25:35,119
was placed from inside the institute.

496
00:25:36,079 --> 00:25:37,440
Hey, Le'er.

497
00:25:37,440 --> 00:25:38,799
Come take a look at this.

498
00:25:38,799 --> 00:25:40,519
Is this the signal repeater you mentioned?

499
00:25:41,240 --> 00:25:42,279
Exactly. That's the one.

500
00:25:42,279 --> 00:25:43,359
I also realized

501
00:25:43,640 --> 00:25:44,920
the biggest variable in this case,

502
00:25:44,920 --> 00:25:47,359
besides the disguise and face-swap,

503
00:25:47,359 --> 00:25:49,000
was the company's secretary.

504
00:25:49,599 --> 00:25:50,640
As long as the secretary

505
00:25:50,640 --> 00:25:52,119
was moving around the company,

506
00:25:52,119 --> 00:25:54,400
she would surely ruin their entire plan.

507
00:25:54,400 --> 00:25:55,480
So these guys

508
00:25:55,480 --> 00:25:56,559
would do whatever it took

509
00:25:56,559 --> 00:25:58,119
to monitor her movements.

510
00:26:31,279 --> 00:26:32,920
Why would there be mud in this pipe?

511
00:26:32,920 --> 00:26:34,559
Plus, there are signs someone crawled through.

512
00:26:35,079 --> 00:26:37,319
So I suspect whoever left the mud...

513
00:26:37,319 --> 00:26:38,680
...and whoever installed this repeater...

514
00:26:38,680 --> 00:26:39,440
...are the same people.

515
00:26:40,759 --> 00:26:41,279
Listen,

516
00:26:41,480 --> 00:26:42,920
I'll head over to Forensics

517
00:26:42,920 --> 00:26:44,920
and have them rush the report.

518
00:26:48,200 --> 00:26:49,319
I'll go lend a hand.

519
00:26:53,519 --> 00:26:54,759
Does this guy always work cases

520
00:26:54,759 --> 00:26:56,519
wound up like clockwork?

521
00:26:58,480 --> 00:27:00,119
This is who he really is.

522
00:27:02,759 --> 00:27:03,559
Back to work.

523
00:28:02,640 --> 00:28:03,680
Ghost's people, huh?

524
00:28:09,079 --> 00:28:09,920
Not classy.

525
00:28:11,519 --> 00:28:12,519
Dog-eat-dog, huh?

526
00:28:47,839 --> 00:28:49,079
I'm not with Ghost.

527
00:28:50,599 --> 00:28:51,519
I know.

528
00:28:52,160 --> 00:28:53,880
Ghost doesn't have anyone this good.

529
00:28:59,519 --> 00:29:01,279
The final payment Ghost owes you...

530
00:29:01,279 --> 00:29:02,400
I've already wired it to you.

531
00:29:02,759 --> 00:29:03,880
I only have one request.

532
00:29:04,400 --> 00:29:06,279
Everything that happened tonight,

533
00:29:06,279 --> 00:29:07,680
tell him every single detail.

534
00:29:07,920 --> 00:29:09,200
And pass along a message for me.

535
00:29:10,640 --> 00:29:11,960
This is a greeting gift.

536
00:29:13,119 --> 00:29:14,119
Classy.

537
00:29:15,079 --> 00:29:16,680
I kind of like your style,

538
00:29:17,039 --> 00:29:18,319
I'm just not quite used to it.

539
00:29:40,519 --> 00:29:41,359
Hello?

540
00:29:42,319 --> 00:29:43,240
Are you there?

541
00:29:43,920 --> 00:29:45,680
Boss, the shipment was hijacked.

542
00:29:47,759 --> 00:29:48,559
What's that supposed to mean?

543
00:29:49,119 --> 00:29:50,400
Trying to hike up the price?

544
00:29:50,880 --> 00:29:51,960
I really did my best.

545
00:29:52,160 --> 00:29:53,279
I tested them for you.

546
00:29:53,279 --> 00:29:54,519
You wouldn't stand a chance either.

547
00:29:55,240 --> 00:29:56,480
They also told me to pass along a message.

548
00:29:56,759 --> 00:29:57,920
They said this is a welcome gift.

549
00:29:58,680 --> 00:29:59,759
I don't care who they are.

550
00:30:00,079 --> 00:30:01,799
You have to get that shipment back for me.

551
00:30:02,200 --> 00:30:03,160
Don't forget,

552
00:30:03,359 --> 00:30:04,680
the final payment hasn't cleared yet.

553
00:30:05,039 --> 00:30:06,000
They already paid me.

554
00:30:06,319 --> 00:30:07,519
Hey, wait, hold on a second...

555
00:30:08,839 --> 00:30:10,599
That's right, paid in full.

556
00:30:11,240 --> 00:30:11,960
Let me ask you something.

557
00:30:11,960 --> 00:30:13,440
What does this drug actually do?

558
00:30:13,440 --> 00:30:14,559
Why is it in such high demand?

559
00:30:14,559 --> 00:30:16,160
If I'd known, I would've charged more.

560
00:30:16,720 --> 00:30:17,920
Hello?

561
00:30:20,839 --> 00:30:21,920
Fine, don't tell me then.

562
00:30:22,880 --> 00:30:25,960
Anyway, whether Lahrburg treats psychosis,

563
00:30:26,839 --> 00:30:28,440
cures constipation, or makes narcotics,

564
00:30:28,440 --> 00:30:29,920
it's none of my business.

565
00:30:29,920 --> 00:30:31,319
Whatever bad blood is between you,

566
00:30:31,319 --> 00:30:32,799
sort it out yourselves.

567
00:30:33,359 --> 00:30:34,160
Thanks.

568
00:30:34,599 --> 00:30:35,279
What a pity.

569
00:30:35,519 --> 00:30:36,000
Goodbye.

570
00:31:03,200 --> 00:31:03,759
Hello?

571
00:31:04,079 --> 00:31:05,440
Did you get the goods?

572
00:31:09,599 --> 00:31:11,400
We ran into a slight hiccup.

573
00:31:12,279 --> 00:31:13,680
Don't worry, though.

574
00:31:14,359 --> 00:31:15,799
I'll handle it.

575
00:31:15,799 --> 00:31:17,359
Without Lahrburg,

576
00:31:17,359 --> 00:31:20,160
the bright future you pictured is gone.

577
00:31:20,160 --> 00:31:23,400
How will you develop a better product?

578
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:24,119
General,

579
00:31:24,119 --> 00:31:26,039
it's just a minor, temporary issue.

580
00:31:26,039 --> 00:31:28,519
Trust me, we'll find a way.

581
00:31:28,519 --> 00:31:30,599
We'll get the Lahrburg, too.

582
